  "reviews_information": {
    "summary": {
      "text": "Customers find these cleaning cloths to be of good quality, offering great value for money and performing excellently for general cleaning tasks. They are durable, holding up well after washing, and customers appreciate their softness, with one noting they're gentle enough for wiping hands and mouths. The washability receives positive feedback for being easy to clean and wring out, though opinions about size are mixed, with some finding them great for most cleaning projects while others say they're much smaller than expected. The thickness receives mixed reviews, with several customers finding them somewhat thin.",
